  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFIT - Global Strategic Partnership for Peace and Reconciliation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership aims to help fragile and conflict-affected states achieve more successful negotiations and transitions out of war or authoritarianism. Through its business model, IFIT seeks to move current practice away from fragmented interventions and toward more integrated solutions that are more likely to strengthen peace, reconciliation and human rights in developing countries. IFIT conducts and publishes original research to add to the state of knowledge on transitions, identify policy gaps.</narrative>
  </description>
